    Database->>-Service: result
    Service->>+Database: Message.findOne({
        chatId: chat?._id,
      })
    Note over Database: 💾 Database Query&#58; MongoDB থেকে data fetch করা হচ্ছে
    Database->>-Service: result
    Service->>+Database: Message.countDocuments({
          chatId: chat?._id,
          sender:)
    Note over Database: 💾 Database Query&#58; MongoDB থেকে data fetch করা হচ্ছে
    Database->>-Service: result
    Service->>Helper_isOnline: isOnline()
    Helper_isOnline-->>Service: result
    Service->>Helper_setUnreadCount: setUnreadCount()
    Helper_setUnreadCount-->>Service: result
    Service->>-Controller: result
    Controller->>-Route: StatusCodes.OK - Chat Retrieve Successfully
    Route-->>Client: Response
